m (CIVIC_MYSTICISM) — needs: Foreign Trade [Boost: Found a pantheon.]\n  -- CLASSICAL --\n  Games and Recreation (CIVIC_GAMES_RECREATION) — needs: State Workforce [Boost: Research the Construction technology.]\n  Political Philosophy (CIVIC_POLITICAL_PHILOSOPHY) — needs: State Workforce, Early Empire [Boost: Meet 3 city-states.]\n  Drama and Poetry (CIVIC_DRAMA_POETRY) — needs: Early Empire [Boost: Build a wonder.]\n  Military Training (CIVIC_MILITARY_TRAINING) — needs: Military Tradition, Games and Recreation [Boost: Build an Encampment.]\n  Defensive Tactics (CIVIC_DEFENSIVE_TACTICS) — needs: Games and Recreation, Political Philosophy [Boost: Be the target of a Declaration of War.]\n  Recorded History (CIVIC_RECORDED_HISTORY) — needs: Political Philosophy, Drama and Poetry [Boost: Build 2 Campus districts.]\n  Theology (CIVIC_THEOLOGY) — needs: Drama and Poetry, Mysticism [Boost: Found a Religion.]\n  -- MEDIEVAL --\n  Naval Tradition (CIVIC_NAVAL_TRADITION) — needs: Defensive Tactics [Boost: Kill a unit with a Quadrireme.]\n  Feudalism (CIVIC_FEUDALISM) — needs: Defensive Tactics [Boost: Build 6 Farms.]\n  Civil Service (CIVIC_CIVIL_SERVICE) — needs: Defensive Tactics, Recorded History [Boost: Grow a city to 10 population.]\n  Mercenaries (CIVIC_MERCENARIES) — needs: Military Training, Feudalism [Boost: Have 8 land combat units in your military.]\n  Medieval Faires (CIVIC_MEDIEVAL_FAIRES) — needs: Feudalism [Boost: Maintain 4 Trade Routes.]\n  Guilds (CIVIC_GUILDS) — needs: Feudalism, Civil Service [Boost: Build 2 Markets.]\n  Divine Right (CIVIC_DIVINE_RIGHT) — needs: Civil Service, Theology [Boost: Build 2 Temples.]"}}}
