{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01RA2yPNmxCSgLbSGDfmgT2g","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My Warrior is now scouting north (at the marsh 8,21, moves spent). Production and research are already on the right track for Vietnam, so no change needed:\n\n- **Production**: Scout — correct call. I have no scout and only 2% of the map revealed; exploration is the top early priority.\n- **Research**: Pottery (10% boosted) → leads to Writing (Campus) and Irrigation. My capital is drowning in jungle/marsh, which is exactly where Vietnam wants Campus/Holy Site districts for big adjacency — so a tech path toward districts is ideal.\n- **Civic**: Code of Laws (only option) already set.\n\nNo settler this start, so growth-then-expand: Scout reveals settle sites while the capital grows toward a settler.\n\n**Summary:** Scouted my coastal jungle/marsh capital (ideal Vietnam terrain), sent the Warrior exploring north, and confirmed Scout production + Pottery research as the correct early-game setup."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":499,"cache_read_input_tokens":38746,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":499},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c1759418-c16f-48fd-8a5f-af5841952d14","uuid":"581122a7-e962-40ee-8c68-688e249c5942","request_id":"req_011CcaKJY5C3rjQ7NeDZzrNw"}
